                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Quiz: Pepsinogen Activation</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Zymogen → enzyme via acid</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"190\" width=\"940\" height=\"780\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"245\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Pepsin Pathway</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"300\" width=\"740\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"360\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">Chief cell</text><text x=\"500\" y=\"360\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">secretes pepsinogen</text><line x1=\"550\" y1=\"415\" x2=\"550\" y2=\"455\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><polygon points=\"540,450 560,450 550,465\" fill=\"#fff\"/><rect x=\"180\" y=\"470\" width=\"740\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"530\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">Lumen</text><text x=\"500\" y=\"530\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">pH &lt; 2 from HCl</text><line x1=\"550\" y1=\"585\" x2=\"550\" y2=\"625\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><polygon points=\"540,620 560,620 550,635\" fill=\"#fff\"/><rect x=\"180\" y=\"640\" width=\"740\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"700\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">Cleavage</text><text x=\"500\" y=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Inhibitory peptide off → pepsin</text><line x1=\"550\" y1=\"755\" x2=\"550\" y2=\"795\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><polygon points=\"540,790 560,790 550,805\" fill=\"#fff\"/><rect x=\"180\" y=\"810\" width=\"740\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"870\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">Active</text><text x=\"500\" y=\"870\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Pepsin cleaves protein → peptides</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "HCl is the trigger; pepsin is the enzyme."
