                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Quiz: Surface Area Amplifiers</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Three nested levels of folding</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"190\" width=\"940\" height=\"780\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"245\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Amplification Factors</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"310\" width=\"740\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"370\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Plicae circulares</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"425\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\">×3 amplification</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"465\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Permanent submucosal folds</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"510\" width=\"740\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"570\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Villi</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"625\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\">×10 amplification</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"665\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Finger-like projections</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"710\" width=\"740\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"770\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Microvilli (brush border)</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"825\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\">×20 amplification — LARGEST</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"865\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Actin-cored, holds enzymes</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"940\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3 × 10 × 20 ≈ 600× total</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "Microvilli win — biggest single multiplier and the enzyme platform."
