"#888\" font-size=\"18\">hCG, hPL, relaxin, progesterone, oxytocin, prolactin</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"820\" width=\"940\" height=\"140\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"880\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">5.</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"880\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Connect the 2 positive feedback loops</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"925\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">LH surge and oxytocin labor cascade</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "Five concrete moves to lock in the system"
